Relationship Types
Deployment → ReplicaSet
1 : M
One Deployment manages one or more ReplicaSets.

ReplicaSet → Pods
1 : M
One ReplicaSet owns multiple Pods.
Example:
ReplicaSet
   |
   +---- Pod-1
   +---- Pod-2
   +---- Pod-3
   +---- Pod-4

Service → Pods
1 : M
A single Service load balances traffic across many Pods.
anihpj-svc
   |
   +---- Pod-1
   +---- Pod-2
   +---- Pod-3
   +---- Pod-4

Pod → Service
M : M
A Pod can belong to multiple Services.
Example:
Pod-1
  |
  +---- frontend-svc
  |
  +---- monitoring-svc
  |
  +---- metrics-svc
This is a true many-to-many relationship.

